er instructions, expected achievements, user instructions, the agent's Thought, and the natural-language\\nvalues inside tool-response templates; the… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/masahiroid/injecagent-ja.\", 'downloads': 851, 'tags': ['language:ja', 'language:en', 'license:mit', 'size_categories:1K<n<10K', 'modality:text', 'arxiv:2403.02691', 'doi:10.57967/hf/10738', 'region:u\nhf_agentdojo 200 [{'_id': '69307594b9eecb327945bffd', 'id': 'Genteki/agentdojo_tiny', 'author': 'Genteki', 'disabled': False, 'gated': False, 'lastModified': '2025-12-03T17:38:29.000Z', 'likes': 0, 'trendingScore': 0, 'private': False, 'sha': 'a6ae67260159dad6403209bd2df119592a1bc70b', 'downloads': 19, 'tags': ['region:us'], 'createdAt': '2025-12-03T17:38:28.000Z', 'key': ''}, {'_id': '69a6a2a459ca5dda6c1376ca', 'id': 'igorshilov/agentdojo-dump', 'author': 'igorshilov', 'disabled': False, 'gated': False, 'lastModified': '2026-03-03T08:58:16.000Z', 'likes': 0, 'trendingScore': 0, 'private': False, 'sha': 'a5513c37f4d22e4dd4f2e7d064e1911e858118f0', 'downloads': 315, 'tags': ['size_categories:10K<n<100K', 'format:parquet', 'modality:text', 'library:datasets', 'library:pandas', 'library:polars', 'library:mlcroissant', 'region:us'], 'createdAt': '2026-03-03T08:58:12.000Z', 'key': ''}, {'_id': '69b40ffc66246467fa7192e9', 'id': 'Junzj/agentdojo-dump', 'author': 'Junzj', 'disabled': False, 'gated': False, 'lastModified': '2026-03-13T13:24:13.000Z', 'likes': 0, 'trendingScore': 0, 'private': False, 'sha': 'ea\nqwen3 200 {'_id': '680da79d48c19d19cf82ab5e', 'id': 'Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'private': False, 'pipeline_tag': 'text-generation', 'library_name': 'transformers', 'tags': ['transformers', 'safetensors', 'qwen3', 'text-generation', 'conversational', 'arxiv:2309.00071', 'arxiv:2505.09388', 'base_model:Qwen/Qwen3-8B-Base', 'base_model:finetune:Qwen/Qwen3-8B-Base', 'license:apache-2.0', 'eval-results', 'text-generation-inference', 'endpoints_compatible', 'dep