{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"cat > literature_review.md <<'EOF'\n# Literature review: benign tool-injection failures\n\nWorking synthesis; detailed chunk notes below will be condensed after resource validation.\n\n## Sequential reading notes\n- AgentDojo chunk 1 (pp. 1–3): dynamic mutable environment, separate user utility and attacker success checks; 97 tasks and 629 security cases. Clean tool capability is a confound, directly motivating the specified eligible-task denominator. Formal state checks avoid compromising an LLM-based environment simulator.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
